    <bpmn:process id="W_W4131" name="W4131. Safety Stock, Reorder Point &amp; Service-Level Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Parameter refresh; service-level review
Frequency: Continuous + per refresh
Volume: ~7.2M parameter sets
Owner: Supply Planning / Network Strategy Lead
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02), Analytics (VS-28), Merchandising (VS-01)
Source: workflow W4131 — Safety Stock, Reorder Point &amp; Service-Level Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4131_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4131_Lane1" name="Supply Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4131_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4131_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4131_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4131_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4131_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4131_Start3" name="Parameter refresh; service-level review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4131_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4131_Task4" name="Supply Planning/Analytics compute safety stock and ROP per SKU per location…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Planning/Analytics compute safety stock and ROP per SKU per location using demand variability, lead-time variability (import 45–90d, local 7–21d links to profile), and the target service level per segment (W4132)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4131_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4131_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4131_Task5" name="Supply Planning optimize the service-level trade-off per segment (cost of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planning optimize the service-level trade-off per segment (cost of inventory vs cost of stockout/lost-sale), and set EOQ balancing order cost vs holding cost
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4131_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4131_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4131_Task6" name="Supply Planning publish optimized safety stock/ROP/EOQ to MDM (W4135), monitor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply Planning publish optimized safety stock/ROP/EOQ to MDM (W4135), monitor service-level adherence and stockouts (W4138), and adjust on signal
Responsible (R): Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4131_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4131_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4131_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4131_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4131_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-639 (ensure controlled execution — Multi-Echelon Inventory Optimization &amp; Service-Level Engineering (PA-136.2).) | - CTL-639: parameters governed (W4135); service-level monitored (W4138)
Owner: Supply Planning / Network Strategy Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
