      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W4132" name="W4132. ABC/XYZ Segmentation &amp; Differentiated Inventory Policy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Segmentation refresh; policy review
Frequency: Quarterly + on change
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs (A: top 20% = 80% revenue; B: 30% = 15%; C: 50% = 5%)
Owner: Merchandising / Supply Planning (VS-02)
Participants: Merchandising (VS-01), Supply Planning (VS-02), Analytics (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4132 — ABC/XYZ Segmentation &amp; Differentiated Inventory Policy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4132_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4132_Lane1" name="Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4132_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4132_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4132_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4132_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4132_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4132_Start3" name="Segmentation refresh; policy review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4132_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4132_Task4" name="Merchandising/Analytics segment SKUs by value (ABC by revenue/contribution) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising/Analytics segment SKUs by value (ABC by revenue/contribution) and variability (XYZ by demand variability), producing a 3×3 matrix, refreshed quarterly
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4132_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4132_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4132_Task5" name="Merchandising/Supply Planning define differentiated inventory policy per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising/Supply Planning define differentiated inventory policy per segment (AX: tight control, high service, frequent review; CZ: minimal/no stock, make-to-order); set service-level targets per segment (W4131)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4132_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4132_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4132_Task6" name="Merchandising/Supply Planning publish segmentation to MDM (W4135), drive policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising/Supply Planning publish segmentation to MDM (W4135), drive policy into replenishment (VS-02), and review segment migration over time
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4132_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4132_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4132_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4132_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
