      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4134_Task4" name="Merchandising/Supply Planning identify slow-movers/long-tail (CZ segment) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising/Supply Planning identify slow-movers/long-tail (CZ segment) and obsolescence risk via aging analysis (links to VS-05 inventory aging), and quantify carrying cost and write-down exposure
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Supply Planning / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4134_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4134_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4134_Task5" name="Merchandising optimize slow-movers: centralize stocking (stock at DC only…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandising optimize slow-movers: centralize stocking (stock at DC only, store-on-request), convert to non-stock/special-order (links to VS-09), bundle/clearance (links to VS-64/VS-32), or discontinue (links to VS-01 lifecycle)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4134_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4134_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4134_Task6" name="Merchandising/Finance manage obsolescence reserves/write-downs (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandising/Finance manage obsolescence reserves/write-downs (links to VS-17), and feed slow-mover learnings into assortment (VS-01)
Responsible (R): Merchandising / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4134_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4134_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
